# Adapted from the upstream Stash override; see sources.json for provenance.
name: 微信 110 解锁
desc: '- 对于被微信内置浏览器拉黑的网址发出通知

  本仓库可选覆写：需本机 CA；来源和调整见 README.md / sources.json。'
category: qsoyq
icon: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Koolson/Qure@master/IconSet/Color/WeChat.png
http:
  mitm:
  - weixin110.qq.com
  - security.wechat.com
  script:
  - match: ^https://(weixin110\.qq|security\.wechat)\.com/cgi-bin/mmspamsupport-bin/newredirectconfirmcgi\?
    name: wx110
    type: response
    require-body: true
    max-size: -1
    timeout: 60
    argument: useCache=false&forceRedirect=false
script-providers:
  wx110:
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ddgksf2013/Scripts/97b8abea5ff52b5874c90d106d241e99894460d1/weixin110.js
    interval: 86400
